  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia: regional cooperation arrangementsIndonesia: regional cooperation arrangements</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Regional Cooperation Arrangement (RCA) is a mechanism through which IOM supports the Government of the Republic of Indonesia in addressing irregular migration issues through regional cooperation. Through this mechanism, IOM assists refugees and asylum seekers in Indonesia with safe accommodations and basic assistances, including health services, mental health and psychosocial support (MHPSS), formal and informal education, and assisted voluntary return and reintegration (AVRR).</narrative>
  </description>
